@title Journey: new project, place parts by keyboard, check, save, reopen
@area Journeys
# Q search places a part at the next click; Ctrl+S on an untitled project asks for a file (answered by the harness).
fresh
key ctrl+n
wait 20
shot new-project
key q
wait 4
text circuit breaker
wait 6
click_text "Miniature circuit breaker, 3-pole" Button
wait 6
click 450 200
wait 6
key Escape
key q
wait 4
text contactor
wait 6
click_text "Contactor main contacts, 3-pole" Button
wait 6
click 450 350
wait 6
key Escape
shot placed
expect_scene F1
expect_scene K1
check_layout
check_blank placed
click_text Check #1
wait 6
shot check-menu
key Escape
answer_dialog ~/Documents/KoperCAD/new-project.kopercad
key ctrl+s
wait 20
shot saved
expect_file ~/Documents/KoperCAD/new-project.kopercad 4000
check_layout
open ~/Documents/KoperCAD/new-project.kopercad
wait 20
expect_scene K1
shot reopened
check_layout
